<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">29082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran's Revolutionary Guard says the Strait of Hormuz is now closed to any vessel that hasn't cleared its passage with Tehran, and will stay closed until Washington honours what the Guard calls its commitments.</s> <s>About a fifth of the world's seaborne oil moves through that channel, so a permitting regime imposed on the water reaches Gulf exporters, Asian refiners, and every insurer writing hull cover in the region.</s> <s>The claim comes from Iranian state media alone... and no independent confirmation of enforcement has surfaced.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ratko Mladić has died serving a life sentence for the Srebrenica genocide, and Belgrade will bury him with full military honours.</s> <s>Survivors point to the gap the Hague tribunal could never close — it convicted a man, but it couldn't convict an ideology, and the states that keep his murals and his songs alive pay no price for doing so.</s> <s>For the families of more than eight thousand dead, and for the besieged of Sarajevo, a verdict is now being answered with a state funeral.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Almost two and a half thousand people remain unaccounted for on the Nepal–Tibet border five days after a glacial outburst flood, among them forty-one Australians.</s> <s>Rescuers believe around one hundred people may still be underground, inside hydropower tunnels cut into the gorge, which is why Kathmandu has accepted Indian teams carrying boring and shoring equipment rather than flood relief.</s> <s>Nearly ninety-three thousand people are affected by the Red Cross count, and the search still can't reach the valleys where the pilgrimage and trekking routes run.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Uzbekistan has passed a law defining the powers of the presidential administration, headed by Saida Mirziyoyeva, the president's daughter, granting its chief sweeping authority and personal immunity from prosecution.</s> <s>What's striking is the legal form — this isn't an informal dynasty of the kind Central Asia has seen before, but a statute writing the successor's office into the constitutional order.</s> <s>Shavkat Mirziyoyev built his government on a promise to end exactly the personalisation his parliament has now codified.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sudanese drones struck a Rapid Support Forces convoy inside Chad's Ennedi region — the first time the war has crossed that border.</s> <s>Washington's arms embargo on Sudan covers Darfur only, which left the Chadian frontier open and turned it into the paramilitary's resupply route.</s> <s>A war already measured in famine and mass displacement now has a second country inside its blast radius.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's foreign minister Ishaq Dar has warned that the Indus Waters Treaty machinery remains legally unresolved, more than a year after New Delhi suspended it.</s> <s>India calls the move abeyance rather than withdrawal, halting data-sharing and arbitration while insisting the treaty still binds — a category that exists nowhere in the text signed in nineteen sixty.</s> <s>The basin sustains around two hundred and fifty million Pakistanis, and they're downstream of an argument about vocabulary.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Bahrain's economy contracted three point eight percent — the first hard national accounts figure putting a price on the Iran conflict for a Gulf state that fired no shots.</s> <s>It's the smallest and least diversified economy in the Gulf, with the thinnest fiscal buffer and the heaviest debt load, so an oil disruption lands on the budget immediately instead of being absorbed by a sovereign fund.</s> <s>Brent's trading near eighty-eight dollars, down four percent, and Manama doesn't control the strait its receipts depend on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukraine already launches around three hundred drones a night, and Volodymyr Zelensky now wants one thousand.</s> <s>Reaching that means tripling the output of a single weapons line, aimed increasingly at Russian refineries like the Slavneft plant at Yaroslavl, to choke fuel exports and the revenue behind them.</s> <s>Kyiv says the strikes will keep growing until Moscow comes to terms — which makes refinery capacity, not territory, the metric to watch.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A White House teleprompter operator read the president's speeches before the president delivered them, bet on Kalshi on what he'd say, and cleared more than one hundred thousand dollars.</s> <s>Gabriel Perez has forfeited the winnings, paid a sixty-five thousand dollar fine and taken a three-year ban, but the edge he traded on wasn't a policy secret — it was advance possession of a script, something no securities regime was ever built to police.</s> <s>Prediction markets have made political speech a tradeable contract, so every staffer with early access to words is now a potential insider.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The European Space Agency has committed five hundred and forty-three million euros to three private launch companies — Isar Aerospace, Rocket Factory Augsburg and PLD Space.</s> <s>The name missing carries the story: MaiaSpace, the ArianeGroup subsidiary, was left out, its award only expected to resume at some undated point, meaning Europe's incumbent rocket maker didn't clear the bar its challengers passed.</s> <s>After fifty years of funding a single national champion, Europe's now buying launch from whoever can deliver it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In the far north of Scotland, a public agency has bought back the Sutherland spaceport it helped pay to build.</s> <s>Orbex, the rocket company that held it, collapsed into administration after a rescue deal fell through, and liquidators sold off the site's assets.</s> <s>Highlands and Islands Enterprise hasn't said whether a rocket will ever launch from the ground it now owns twice over.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mongolia hosted the UN desertification summit as a country losing its grazing land in real time — roughly three quarters of its territory is degraded — and asked for finance rather than declarations.</s> <s>Delegates pledged one point two nine billion dollars for rangelands, but restored grassland produces no tradeable unit the way carbon does, so donor money keeps flowing to measurable tonnes instead of dryland soil.</s> <s>For herders from the Sahel to the steppe, whose winter dzud losses are now structural rather than seasonal, a promise without a payment instrument is the whole problem.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Cognyte, an Israeli surveillance firm spun out of Verint, has won cell-site simulator contracts with police in Washington, New York and Texas.</s> <s>A simulator impersonates a phone mast and captures traffic from every handset that connects to it, not just the target's — the same hardware the company sold to Myanmar's military, and which Florida used to track Haitian refugees.</s> <s>Departments named in the contract documents declined to comment on how often it's switched on, or who else it sweeps up.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Print management software from the Australian firm PaperCut is under active attack, and defenders learned about the flaw from the intrusions rather than the advisory.</s> <s>Print servers are an unglamorous prize with domain-level credentials, sitting inside hospitals, universities and ministries with almost no monitoring — which is why PaperCut bugs have been ransomware doorways before.</s> <s>The longest-exposed systems will be on-premise deployments in institutions where upgrading costs licensing money nobody budgeted.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers have found more than sixteen hundred papers on the repository Zenodo attributed to authors who don't exist.</s> <s>Identity checks through <sub alias="ORCID">ORCID</sub>, the standard researcher registry, are voluntary, and peer review interrogates the manuscript rather than the person who signed it.</s> <s>Since citation counts drive hiring and grant decisions, fabricated names don't just pollute a database — they redistribute real money.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Italian digital rights collective Autistici and Inventati announced its own US sanctions designation on its homepage.</s> <s>Its users are mostly European activists, and financial intermediaries exposed to American sanctions law tend to sever ties within days rather than test the penalties.</s> <s>Whether those mailboxes survive the month depends on institutions none of the account holders will ever speak to.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>